  "beats": [
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "Following two delays, further leaks, and an extensive marketing campaign, the game was released on 19 November 2026 for PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X and S, to universal critical acclaim.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1386740634:12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "As of October 2026, no Windows release was scheduled.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1386740634:161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "Grand Theft Auto VI is a 2026 action-adventure game developed and published by Rockstar Games.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1386740634:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "Aaron Garbut is credited as artist, and Justice is credited for music.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:box:1386740634:artist",
        "wiki:box:1386740634:music"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:27Z",
      "text": "Rockstar Games is listed as publisher, and the game's release date is given as 19 November 2026.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:box:1386740634:publisher",
        "wiki:box:1386740634:released"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:30Z",
      "text": "Readers also turned to Grand Theft Auto with 171,292 readers, Rockstar Games with 112,864, and Grand Theft Auto V with 108,371.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Grand_Theft_Auto:2026-11-19",
        "views:en:Rockstar_Games:2026-11-19",
        "views:en:Grand_Theft_Auto_V:2026-11-19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:39Z",
      "text": "On 19 November 2026, 750,227 people read about the game, about 45 times the usual number.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Grand_Theft_Auto_VI:2026-11-19",
        "views:en:Grand_Theft_Auto_VI:prior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:46Z",
      "text": "The article was read in 11 languages, and after English, German was the most read, with 73,626 readers.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Grand_Theft_Auto_VI:2026-11-19",
        "views:de:Grand_Theft_Auto_VI:2026-11-19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:53Z",
      "text": "Each language glows where it is mainly spoken, brighter for more readers, and a language is not a country.",
      "cites": [
        "views:de:Grand_Theft_Auto_VI:2026-11-19",
        "views:ru:Grand_Theft_Auto_VI:2026-11-19",
        "views:fr:Grand_Theft_Auto_VI:2026-11-19",
        "views:es:Grand_Theft_Auto_VI:2026-11-19",
        "views:it:Grand_Theft_Auto_VI:2026-11-19",
        "views:zh:俠盜獵車手VI:2026-11-19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:01:03Z",
      "text": "DW asked in its headline what makes Grand Theft Auto VI more than just a game.",
      "cites": [
        "news:dw:24b2767125c4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:01:09Z",
      "text": "France 24 called it a masterpiece 13 years in the making.",
      "cites": [
        "news:france24:22a76eb8d6c6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:01:15Z",
      "text": "The Guardian reported that fans skip work and pull all-nighters to play the new instalment.",
      "cites": [
        "news:guardian:fc139917d31c"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:01:24Z",
      "text": "The sources are Wikipedia articles, Wikimedia pageviews and Wikidata, and every caption links to the evidence it rests on.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1386740634:12",
        "views:en:Grand_Theft_Auto_VI:2026-11-19",
        "wd:Q23648408:P31"
      ]
    }
  ],
